      "text": "\tAlthough the Hai tend to be an easygoing and nonviolent species, there are always a few in each generation that yearn for excitement, warfare, and conquest. These \"Unfettered\" Hai have built a major military base here, and they launch raids from here on convoys traveling through the nearby systems.",
