          {
            "key": "description",
            "values": [
              "Darkcloak is a world that is almost always obscured by a thick layer of clouds, making it difficult to produce food here."
            ],
            "children": null
          },
          {
            "key": "description",
            "values": [
              "\tAlthough the Hai tend to be an easygoing and nonviolent species, there are always a few in each generation that yearn for excitement, warfare, and conquest. These \"Unfettered\" Hai have built a major military base here, and they launch raids from here on convoys traveling through the nearby systems."
            ],
            "children": null
          },
          {
            "key": "spaceport",
            "values": [
              "The occupants of this spaceport are not visibly different from the Hai you have encountered elsewhere, but they seem much more tense, angry, and hostile. As the only human here, you are being watched very closely, but no one threatens you directly."
            ],
            "children": null
          },
          {
            "key": "spaceport",
            "values": [
              "\tIt is likely that most of the goods available for trade here were stolen from one of the nearby Hai systems."
